<title>UK: LME - warehouse stock movements.</title>
<headline>LME - warehouse stock movements.</headline>
<text>
<p>LONDON, Aug 01 - Latest LME warehouse stock changes are: copper up  7150, tin down 15, lead down 25, zinc up 5100, aluminium down 375,  nickel up 114, aluminium alloy down 80</p>
</text>
